    "title": "MICROSERVICE_DEV_SIM Swap Management API",
    "description": "The SIM Swap Management API facilitates seamless and secure SIM card swaps for customers, enabling service providers to handle requests efficiently. This endpoint allows authorized users to submit new SIM swap requests, ensuring quick updates to customer accounts and maintaining service continuity. Typical consumers include customer support teams and backend systems managing mobile number portability and subscriber identity management. With this API, businesses can enhance customer satisfaction by streamlining the SIM swapping process, reducing downtime for users in need of service changes.",
